      "title": "EAMET: Robust Massive Model Editing via Embedding Alignment Optimization",
      "title_zh": "EAMET：基于嵌入对齐优化的鲁棒大规模模型编辑",
      "authors": [
        "Yanbo Dai",
        "Zhenlan Ji",
        "Zongjie Li",
        "Shuai Wang"
      ],
      "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2505.11876v4",
