      "title": "Sparse probes and murky physics: a case study of interpretability challenges in a foundation model for continuum dynamics",
      "title_zh": "稀疏探针与模糊物理：连续介质动力学基础模型可解释性挑战案例研究",
      "authors": [
        "Katherine Rosenfeld",
        "Maike Sonnewald"
      ],
      "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2606.11657v1",
      "pdf_url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2606.11657v1",
