      "title": "Leverage Is Not Reach: A Control-Window Law for Single-Neuron Steering in Language Models",
      "title_zh": "杠杆非可达：大语言模型中单神经元引导的控制窗定律",
      "authors": [
        "Hongliang Liu"
      ],
      "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2606.19831v1",
      "pdf_url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2606.19831v1",
