      "week": "2026-W27",
      "title": "UCOB: Learning to Utilize and Evolve Agentic Skills via Credit-Aware On-Policy Bidirectional Self-Distillation",
      "title_zh": "UCOB：通过信用感知同策略双向自蒸馏学习利用和演化智能体技能",
      "authors": [
        "Songjun Tu",
        "Chengdong Xu",
        "Qichao Zhang",
        "Yiwen Ma",
        "Yaocheng Zhang",
        "Linjing Li",
        "Dong Li",
        "Xiangyuan Lan",
        "Dongbin Zhao"
      ],
      "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2606.29502v1",
      "pdf_url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2606.29502v1",
      "category": "cs.AI",
      "published": "2026-06-28 17:02:18+00:00",
      "collected": "2026-06-30",
      "abstract": "Skill memories can improve agentic reinforcement learning by reusing past experience as textual guidance, but retrieved skills are not oracular: they may help in one state while misleading the same policy in another. This makes the common privileged-teacher assumption fragile, namely that a skill-conditioned prompt can be treated as a fixed teacher for the no-skill prompt. We introduce UCOB, a framework for learning to utilize and evolve agentic skills via credit-aware on-policy bidirectional self-distillation. UCOB treats skill-conditioned and no-skill prompts as two on-policy context views of the same model, compares their return-to-go within the same task and anchor state, and uses the higher-return view as the local teacher. This local credit signal internalizes useful skill-conditioned behavior, corrects misleading skill usage, and guides task/state skill memory updates, utility-aware retrieval, and reflection self-training. Experiments on agentic tasks, including ALFWorld, WebShop, and Search-QA, show that UCOB outperforms skill-free RL, skill-memory baselines, and self-distillation methods across model scales, with up to 23.5 and 18.0 point gains over SOTA baselines on ALFWorld and WebShop. Ablations and analyses further validate its core mechanisms and efficiency.",
      "abstract_zh": "技能记忆可通过复用过往经验提升智能体强化学习，但检索到的技能效果依赖状态，可能误导策略，打破了原有的特权教师假设。本文提出UCOB框架，将带技能和不带技能的提示作为同一模型的两个同策略上下文视图，选择更高回报的视图作为局部教师，更新技能记忆与检索，在多个基准实验中取得显著性能提升，验证了机制的有效性与效率。",
      "has_code": false,
      "repo_url": "",
      "repo_stars": 0,
      "hf_upvotes": 0,
      "citation_count": 0,
      "venue": "",
      "venue_year": "",
      "venue_type": "",
      "venue_url": "",
      "venue_confidence": "",
      "venue_source": "",
      "is_authority_venue": false,
      "ingest_source": "",
      "manual_reason": "",
      "manual_tags": [],
      "problem": "现有技能记忆依赖特权教师假设，检索到的技能效果随状态变化，可能在部分状态下误导策略。",
      "method": "提出UCOB框架，通过信用感知同策略双向自蒸馏，选择高回报视图作为局部教师修正技能使用、更新技能记忆。",
      "contribution": "提出新的智能体技能学习框架，在多个任务上超出SOTA，ALFWorld和WebShop分别最高涨23.5、18.0个点。",
      "limitations": "摘要未提及",
      "key_finding": "该方法跨不同模型尺度均优于基线，在ALFWorld和WebShop上相比SOTA分别最高提升23.5和18.0个百分点。",
      "theme": "智能体技能学习",
      "method_family": "agent harness",
      "agent_setting": "tool-use/web/search/QA",
      "control_mechanism": "通过信用感知同策略双向自蒸馏，将高回报上下文视图作为局部教师，修正误导性技能使用并更新技能记忆。",
      "evaluation_environment": "ALFWorld、WebShop、Search-QA智能体任务基准",
      "evaluation_signal": "跨不同模型尺度均优于所有对比基线，在ALFWorld和WebShop相比SOTA分别获得最高23.5、18.0个百分点的提升。",
      "failure_mode": "检索技能的效果依赖状态，会误导策略，原有固定特权教师的假设不成立。",
      "reliability_risk": "仅在标准学术基准验证，未在真实复杂开放场景测试，落地泛化性有待进一步验证。",
      "industrial_relevance": "high",
