      "title": "COSMIC: Leader-Driven Context-Oriented Collaboration Between Agents",
      "title_zh": "《COSMIC：领导者驱动的面向上下文的智能体间协作框架》",
      "authors": [
        "Vansh Vashishtha",
        "Sonali Pandey",
        "Y. Singh",
        "Arshdeep Bahga",
        "Vijay K. Madisetti"
      ],
      "url": "https://www.semanticscholar.org/paper/c1cb1b8405a2e739d7f97bdc602ab85195a8bcaf",
      "pdf_url": "",
      "category": "via-citation",
      "published": "",
      "collected": "2026-06-05",
      "abstract": "We present COSMIC, a leader-driven multiagent coordination framework that extends the AutoGen GroupChat paradigm to support more stable and context-consistent collaboration among large language model (LLM) agents. COSMIC introduces: 1) a leader agent that decomposes tasks and issues an explicit termination decision; 2) a shared rolling memory buffer that synchronizes recent context across agents; and 3) a speaker selector agent (SSA) that enforces structured turn-taking and mitigates self-invocation and speaker imbalance. Across six coordination-intensive tasks, COSMIC achieves 100% validity under task-specific hard-constraint criteria. On the five tasks where baseline frameworks produced validated outputs, COSMIC improves composite scores by 20.2%, 23.3%, 27.7%, 52.6%, and 46.9% over CrewAI Hierarchical, CrewAI Sequential, AutoGen, LangChain, and OpenAI Swarm, respectively. COSMIC reduces wall-clock time relative to CrewAI Hierarchical, CrewAI Sequential, AutoGen, and LangChain by 57.3%, 50.8%, 61.4%, and 77.6%, while incurring higher runtime than OpenAI Swarm due to richer coordination and memory overhead. On GSM8K, COSMIC attains $94\\pm 1$% accuracy, exceeding the sparse multiagent debate (MAD) configuration reported in a Google Research publication. Empirically, performance peaks around five agents, reflecting a trade-off between diversity and coordination overhead.",
      "abstract_zh": "本文提出领导者驱动的多智能体协调框架COSMIC，扩展了AutoGen群聊范式，支持大语言模型智能体实现更稳定、上下文一致的协作。框架包含领导者智能体、共享滚动记忆缓冲、发言选择器三个核心模块，在六个协调密集型任务上达到100%有效性，相比多个主流基线框架大幅提升复合分数、降低运行时间，在GSM8K上准确率达94±1%，性能在5个智能体时达到峰值。",
      "has_code": false,
