      "title": "A Systematic Review of Agentic AI in Healthcare: An Evidence-Informed Seven-Principle Framework",
      "title_zh": "医疗领域智能体AI的系统综述：基于证据的七原则框架",
      "authors": [
        "Chandra Prakash",
        "Avneesh Sisodia",
        "Mary Lind"
      ],
      "url": "https://www.semanticscholar.org/paper/84eb9aa340b2de5a0184a3830ebc00ce4bcdfc80",
